  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新 Discord 伺服器！提供私人支援與更新通知。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>描述：</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">《</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>附魔怪物房間</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">》模組將強化</span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">Minecraft 中類似地牢的房間，將其轉化為更具動態、更危險且報酬更豐厚的環境。使用此模組後，你將遭遇</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>更優質的怪物房間</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">，內含</span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">更強的怪物以及隱藏寶藏，考驗你的生存技巧。每個怪物房間現在都融入了</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>附魔元素</strong>,</span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">包括隨機生成的 Boss 戰、環境危害以及用於解鎖稀有戰利品的隱藏寶藏。玩家必須運用策略與機智來克服這些強化過的房間。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：此模組不會取代原有的怪物房間！</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/399/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1024\" height=\"64\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>強化怪物</strong>:</span> 更強壯、更聰明，有時還帶有附魔的敵人將守護房間，要求玩家採取更具策略性的行動。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/399/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1024\" height=\"64\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/409/file.png\" alt=\"守衛\" width=\"378\" height=\"489\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/402/skeleton_je6_be4.webp\" alt=\"骷髏\" width=\"235\" height=\"434\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/401/stray_je1_be3.webp\" alt=\"流浪者\" width=\"309\" height=\"479\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"line-height:40.6px\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/392/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"1024\" height=\"188\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/372/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"地牢\" width=\"1920\" height=\"972\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/313/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelliJ\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模組使用 IntelliJ 開發</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>產品免責聲明：非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 認可或與其關聯。</h1>",
